  "description": "Harmonic potential at maximum depth — the soliton trapped in a quadratic well, oscillating between walls. Low filter cutoff, long release, deep resonance. The wave function of a particle in a harmonic trap: discrete energy levels, each note landing on an allowed quantum state. The bottom of the potential well is silent.",
